    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The slime girl &quot;Ramune&quot; rises up to protect the forest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute and sexy mini-Metroidvania with themes of &quot;undress&quot; and &quot;goofiness&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The estimated play time is about 20 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the main story, the &quot;Gallery (character encyclopedia)&quot; and &quot;Boss Battles&quot; will be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be controlled using a keyboard or gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the key assignments for the &quot;jump&quot; and &quot;charge&quot; keys on the &quot;Options&quot; screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis game is a sequel to &quot;Ramune's Forest,&quot; a free game created by our circle in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe difficulty level of the action games has been set low. The puzzles might be a little tricky in some places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThere are no depictions of genitals or sexual intercourse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThere is no farting element.</p>",
